":"Pop ambient","scene_id":220379309106676,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/#pop-ambient","chapters":["Loops 2 · Cap. 8: Repetición y sentido: escultores de ambientes, guerrilleros del ruido, nuevos contemporáneos y otras escenas experimentales"],"pages":[[2,264]]},{"id":256598943774543,"artist":"The Field","artist_id":62428798906200,"title":"Yesterday and Today","year":2009,"ess":0,"yt":"V1oiVcVBA5I","kind":null,"book":{"id":10,"title":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/"},"scene":"Pop ambient","scene_id":220379309106676,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/#pop-ambient","chapters":["Loops 2 · Cap. 8: Repetición y sentido: escultores de ambientes, guerrilleros del ruido, nuevos contemporáneos y otras escenas experimentales"],"pages":[[2,264]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","page":264,"text":"…ambient contemporáneo que emerge del shoegaze y en ella las melodías están marcadas a fuego, como en The Sight Below o Loveliescrushing— a Klimek o The Field, el alias del productor sueco Axel Willner. El primer EP de The Field —«Things Keep Falling Down» (2005)— abría una brecha inesperada en el bloque del minimal techno que daba personalidad a Kompakt: Willner estaba…"},{"book":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","page":264,"text":"…que, aunque repetitivo, se volvía más poroso. A partir de sus trabajos en largo —From Here We Go Sublime (2007) o Yesterday and Today (2009)—, The Field era la mayor sensación europea de la música repetitiva con un toque arrebatador, psicodelia que añoraba las viejas fiestas trance tras una cascada…"},{"book":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","page":265,"text":"…al estilo James Holden. Su álbum Immunity (2013), una cascada de glitches engarzados sobre basslines afiladas y bombos con aristas, es el camino que The Field no quiso tomar para llegar a su reivindicación del trance como perfecto abandono del cuerpo y la mente: olvidarse de simplificar y esforzarse en…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":260313849894168,"type":"album","name":"From Here We Go Sublime","work_year":2007,"list_id":44735175437010,"list":"AOTY Must Hear 2000s","src":"charts","rank":148,"year":2007,"note":null,"yt":"GeJEKCZLbTE","scaruffi":null},{"id":260313849894168,"type":"album","name":"From Here We Go Sublime","list_id":168313144576350,"list":"RYM Top — Dance","src":"musthear","rank":39,"year":2007,"note":null,"yt":"GeJEKCZLbTE","scaruffi":null},{"id":260313849894168,"type":"album","name":"From Here We Go Sublime","list_id":92562408881921,"list":"RYM Top — Dance — Minimal Techno","src":"musthear","rank":1,"year":2007,"note":null,"yt":"GeJEKCZLbTE","scaruffi":null},{"id":260313849894168,"type":"album","name":"From Here We Go Sublime","list_id":217173958930205,"list":"RYM Top — Dance — Tech House","src":"musthear","rank":1,"year":2007,"note":null,"yt":"GeJEKCZLbTE","scaruffi":null},{"id":260313849894168,"type":"album","name":"From Here We Go Sublime","list_id":15302027328081,"list":"RYM Top — Electronic","src":"musthear","rank":140,"year":2007,"note":null,"yt":"GeJEKCZLbTE","scaruffi":null},{"id":260313849894168,"type":"album","name":"From Here We Go Sublime","list_id":265709776421053,"list":"RYM Top — Electronic — Electronic Dance Music","src":"musthear","rank":26,"year":2007,"note":null,"yt":"GeJEKCZLbTE","scaruffi":null},{"id":260313849894168,"type":"album","name":"From Here We Go Sublime","list_id":66579945656171,"list":"RYM Top — Electronic — House","src":"musthear","rank":10,"year":2007,"note":null,"yt":"GeJEKCZLbTE","scaruffi":null},{"id":260313849894168,"type":"album","name":"From Here We Go Sublime","list_id":9864029969651,"list":"RYM Top — Electronic — Techno","src":"musthear",